    <!-- TAB: BANK STATEMENT RECONCILIATION -->
    <section id="section-statement" class="hidden space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">Upload Bank Statement</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">Upload the account statement (.xls/.xlsx) any time you have an updated export. Rows already imported from an earlier upload are skipped automatically, so overlapping statements simply compile into one running record.</p>
        <form onsubmit="handleStatementUpload(event)" class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-1">Statement file</label>
            <input type="file" id="statement-file" accept=".xls,.xlsx" required class="p-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white outline-none">
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md">Upload &amp; Import</button>
          <span id="statement-upload-result" class="text-xs font-semibold"></span>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">Registrations with a Payment Ref</p>
          <p id="rec-metric-total" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 mt-1">0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase">Matched in Statement</p>
          <p id="rec-metric-matched" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-700 mt-1">0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50/30 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 uppercase">Not Found in Statement</p>
          <p id="rec-metric-unmatched" class="text-2xl font-black text-rose-700 mt-1">0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/30 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase">Unmatched Credits in Bank</p>
          <p id="rec-metric-credits" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-700 mt-1">0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">Marked Non-Registration</p>
          <p id="rec-metric-nonreg" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-600 mt-1">0</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-rose-700 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Registrations Not Found in Statement</h3>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse sm:min-w-[700px] text-sm">
            <thead class="hidden sm:table-header-group"><tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Reg No</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Delegate</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Mode</th><th class="py-3 px-4">UTR / Txn No.</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Amount</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody id="rec-unmatched-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-100"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cash taken at the desk is verified the moment it's collected, but it
           isn't BANKED until someone deposits the day's takings as one credit
           covering many registrations. Until then it's money in a drawer with
           nothing in the statement to match it against, which is what this
           panel surfaces. Hidden when there is none. -->
      <div id="cash-in-hand-panel" class="hidden">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">💵 Cash at the Desk — Not Yet Banked</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">Collected in person and already counted towards each delegate's fee. Select the collections that went into a single bank deposit, pick that deposit, and link them together.</p>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 bg-emerald-50/50 border-b border-emerald-100">
            <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600">
              <input type="checkbox" id="cash-select-all" onchange="toggleAllCashRows(this.checked)">
              Select all
            </label>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500"><span id="cash-selected-count" class="font-bold text-slate-700">0</span> of <span id="cash-total-count" class="font-bold text-slate-700">0</span> selected · <span id="cash-selected-total" class="font-bold text-emerald-700">₹0</span> of <span id="cash-grand-total" class="font-bold text-slate-700">₹0</span> in hand</span>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-2">
              <select id="cash-deposit-select" class="p-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-xs bg-white outline-none max-w-[320px]"></select>
              <button type="button" id="cash-deposit-btn" onclick="submitCashDeposit()" class="px-3 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg">Link to Deposit</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse sm:min-w-[720px] text-sm">
              <thead class="hidden sm:table-header-group"><tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">
                <th class="py-3 px-4 w-10"></th><th class="py-3 px-4">Collected</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Delegate</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Reg No</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Amount ₹</th>
              </tr></thead>
              <tbody id="cash-in-hand-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-100"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p id="cash-deposit-result" class="hidden px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold border-t border-slate-100"></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Bank Credits Not Matched to a Registration</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">Includes non-UPI credits (NEFT/RTGS/IMPS) which don't carry a machine-readable reference — match these manually by amount, date, and description. If a credit will never belong to a registration (bank charges, interest, an unrelated transfer), mark it as non-registration instead of leaving it here.</p>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse sm:min-w-[820px] text-sm">
            <thead class="hidden sm:table-header-group"><tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Date</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Description</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Credit ₹</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Actions</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody id="rec-credits-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-100"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Non-Registration Transactions</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">Credits marked as not belonging to any registration. They're excluded from matching and can't be linked to a payment — unmark to bring one back into the pool.</p>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse sm:min-w-[820px] text-sm">
            <thead class="hidden sm:table-header-group"><tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">
              <th class="py-3 px-4">Date</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Description</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Credit ₹</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Actions</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody id="rec-nonreg-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-100"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wide">Matched <span id="rec-matched-count" class="text-slate-400 font-normal normal-case"></span></h3>
          <input type="text" id="rec-matched-search" oninput="filterMatchedRows()" placeholder="Search reg no, name, UTR, description…" class="w-full sm:w-72 p-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm outline-none">
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse sm:min-w-[1000px] text-sm">
            <thead class="hidden sm:table-header-group"><tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">
              <th class="py-3 px-4">#</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Reg No</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Delegate</th><th class="py-3 px-4">UTR / Txn No.</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Statement Date</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Description</th><th class="py-3 px-4">Amount</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody id="rec-matched-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-100"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
